* 9.Within 5 years, the subject has other malignant tumors in the past or at the same time and needs active treatment (except for fully treated basal cell or squamous cell skin cancer, cervical carcinoma in situ and breast cancer in situ, if the estimated 5-year survival rate is more than 90%);
